OL,3,GNEWSASelf-driving shuttles feature in
OL,4,Atransport plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrams and self-driving shuttle buses
OL,7,Fare among the proposals aimed at
OL,8,Fhelping a growing town meet its
OL,9,Ftransport needs.
OL,11,FThey are part of a draft transport plan
OL,12,Ffor Northampton for the next 10 years,
OL,13,Fwhich has been published by West
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire Council.
OL,16,FThe town had a population of 250,000,
OL,17,Fbut would be "rapidly expanding" and in
OL,18,Fneed of alternatives to private cars by
OL,19,F2036, said the report.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
