OL,3,GNEWSASelf-driving shuttles feature in
OL,4,Atransport plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrently, 13% of journeys to work in
OL,7,FNorthampton are by foot or bike, 8% by
OL,8,Fbus and 1% by rail.
